38263>>>>>>>>>
38263>>>>>>>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38263>>>>>>>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38263>>>>>>>>>
38263>>>>>>>>>        Case End
